    "analysis_takeaway": "All five detected arrays form one evolutionary group. The input-order model is decisively favored (ΔlnL +15.50): both hypotheses require 42 first acquisitions, but the supported history needs 4 deletions and 1 root acquisition, whereas reversing the order needs 45 deletions and places all 42 acquisitions at the root.",
