      "displayed_locus_bases": 8380,
      "masking_policy": "Headers and public record metadata use neutral example_record identifiers.",
      "provenance_note": "The example was selected from the publication supplementary cohort for its clear evolutionary signal; organism, strain, accession, and source-coordinate identity are omitted.",
